    "html": "<p>A graph illustrating the radioactive decay of a specific isotope is shown below. The graph plots the fraction of nuclei remaining (<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"N/N_{0}\"></span>) against the time elapsed in days.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the probability that a nucleus has decayed by day <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"15\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.125\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.500\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.750\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.875\"></span></p></li></ol>"
